<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<style>
  body { font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #1a1f26; color: #ffffff; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
  .container { max-width: 500px; margin: 0 auto; background: #25282e; padding: 40px; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); }
  h1 { color: #9b51e0; margin-bottom: 30px; font-size: 24px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; }
  .code { font-size: 36px; font-weight: bold; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3); padding: 15px 30px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px dashed #9b51e0; letter-spacing: 5px; color: #fff; margin: 30px 0; display: inline-block; }
  p { font-size: 16px; color: #a0aec0; line-height: 1.5; }
  .footer { margin-top: 40px; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Pokercito.lol</h1>
    <p>Welcome to the ultimate poker experience! To complete your registration, please enter the following verification code:</p>
    <div class="code">{{ .RegistrationCode }}</div>
    <p>If you didn't attempt to create an account, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
    <div class="footer">© Pokercito.lol - See you at the tables!</div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
